 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "<p>A survey of college students asked how many courses those students were currently taking. The results are summarized in this frequency distribution:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Classes</th>\n<th>Frequency</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 531534,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the mode of the number of classes.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "3"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "The mode is the most frequently occurring data value. The most frequently occurring number is 3. The mode is 3."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 531535,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the median of the number of classes.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Add the frequencies: 1 + 3 + 16 + 8 + 4 = 32</p>\n<p>If <i>n</i> is even, then add the values at the <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{2}\"></span> and <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{2} + 1\"></span> positions, then divide by 2 to find the median.</p>\n<p>Since there are 30 data values, use the even method.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{2} = \\frac{{32}}{2} = 16\"></span> and <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{2} + 1= 17\"></span></p>\n<p>You can use the table to find the 16<sup>th</sup> and 17<sup>th</sup> values.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Classes</th>\n<th>Frequency</th>\n<th>Cumulative Frequency</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1 + 3 = 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>4 + 16 = 20<br>\nYou know the 16<sup>th</sup> and 17<sup>th</sup> data value are both in this category!</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The 16<sup>th</sup> and 17<sup>th</sup> values are both 3.</p>\n<p>Add them up and divide by 2: <span data-math=\"\\frac{{3 + 3}}{2} = 3= 82.5\"></span></p>\n<p>The median is 3.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "3"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 531536,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the mean of the number of classes.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Let the table do your math.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Classes</th>\n<th>Frequency</th>\n<th>Number of Classes Times Frequency</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>48</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>32</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SUMS</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>107</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Mean</td>\n<td>107 ÷ 32 ≈ 3.344</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The mean is approximately 3.344.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\frac{107}{32} \\approx 3.344\">\\frac{107}{32} \\approx 3.344</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
